<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:aapt="http://schemas.android.com/aapt"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <!-- Allah (الله) in square Kufic (kufi murabbaʿ). Original artwork: drawn
         on a 7×7 grid, one unit per stroke and one per gap, so no typeface
         is involved and no font licence applies. The initial alif is laid
         horizontally over the word, the standard squaring liberty of the
         script; lam and lam are the verticals, the final heh is the closed
         box, and the baseline joins heh to both lams.

         v2 presentation (1.3): the geometry is untouched; the group below
         scales it about the centre, so the mark stays clear of the plate's
         edge while its ink mass stays centred. The fill is top-lit gold, a
         quiet vertical step that suggests foil stamping without pretending
         at 3D; the monochrome layer shares this drawable and tints by
         alpha, which the gradient holds at 100% everywhere.

         v3 presentation (1.34, owner decision): the scale steps back from
         1.166 to 1.0, the mark at its drawn 37.98 units (35.2% of the
         canvas). The 1.166 launch size was judged against the raw vector's
         mask, but a launcher draws the 108-unit canvas inside 72 units of
         its own, and on the S23's grid 41% read as crowding its plate: in
         the app drawer and in the notification, which wears the same plate
         behind the same mark. The scale stays an explicit group, so the
         size remains one number to turn. The legacy mipmaps take the same
         step; the store icon is unmasked, carries its mark larger under its
         own convention, and was left at that size. -->
    <group
        android:scaleX="1.0"
        android:scaleY="1.0"
        android:pivotX="54"
        android:pivotY="54">
    <path
        android:pathData="M35.012,33.428h37.976v5.425h-37.976zM35.012,44.279h16.276v5.425h-16.276zM56.713,44.279h5.425v27.127h-5.425zM67.563,44.279h5.425v27.127h-5.425zM35.012,49.704h5.425v21.701h-5.425zM45.863,49.704h5.425v21.701h-5.425zM40.437,65.980h5.425v5.425h-5.425zM51.287,65.980h5.425v5.425h-5.425zM62.137,65.980h5.425v5.425h-5.425z">
            <aapt:attr name="android:fillColor">
                <gradient
                    android:type="linear"
                    android:startX="54"
                    android:startY="33.428"
                    android:endX="54"
                    android:endY="71.406"
                    android:startColor="#DFBD5F"
                    android:endColor="#C9AB55" />
            </aapt:attr>
        </path>
    </group>
</vector>